---
import DemoFrame from './DemoFrame.astro';
import GoTimeoutCascadeDemo from '../demos/GoTimeoutCascadeDemo.tsx';
---
<figure class="gtc-figure">
  <DemoFrame title="One deadline, three nested calls" titleVi="Một deadline, ba lời gọi lồng nhau">
    <GoTimeoutCascadeDemo client:visible />
  </DemoFrame>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Move the deadline below the query time and the innermost call stops early; each caller above it just passes the error up. Numbers are the slider values, not a measurement.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Kéo deadline xuống thấp hơn thời gian query thì lời gọi trong cùng dừng sớm; các hàm bên trên chỉ chuyển lỗi lên. Số liệu là giá trị thanh trượt, không phải số đo.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style is:global>
  .gtc-figure { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gtc-figure > .demo-frame { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .gtc-figure > figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
  .gtc-slider { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; flex: 1 1 240px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 600; }
  .gtc-slider b { color: var(--text); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gtc-slider input { width: 100%; }
  .gtc-track { position: relative; height: 28px; margin-top: 14px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 6px; background: var(--bg); overflow: hidden; }
  .gtc-work { position: absolute; inset: 0 auto 0 0; }
  .gtc-work.is-ok { background: var(--gold-tint-bg); border-right: 2px solid var(--gold); }
  .gtc-work.is-cut { background: var(--text-muted); opacity: 0.45; }
  .gtc-mark { position: absolute; top: 0; bottom: 0; width: 0; border-left: 2px dashed var(--red); }
  .gtc-axis { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 4px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); }
  .gtc-calls { list-style: none; margin: 14px 0 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 8px; }
  .gtc-calls li { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px 12px; align-items: baseline; padding: 8px 10px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; background: var(--bg); font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-body); }
  .gtc-calls li:nth-child(2) { margin-left: 14px; }
  .gtc-calls li:nth-child(3) { margin-left: 28px; }
  .gtc-calls code { font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); }
</style>
